  "description": "Our most affordable model in the Munroe line, the AL, is a fun urban bike happy to take you to work and back in comfort thanks to its upright position, simple 1 x 8 Microshift drivetrain and those large volume Kenda 650 x 45 mm tyres. But the Munroe AL is capable of much more. The lightweight frame and fork have mounts for the obligatory rack and fenders, should you wish to ride through the winter. If the weekly grind gets too much, we’ve added bottle and triple cage mounts so you can escape for the weekend with just a few pedal strokes.",
